sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Script (session 21)
    participant D as Device
    participant B as Other session 22
    S->>D: <lock><target><candidate/></target></lock>
    D-->>S: <ok/>
    B->>D: <lock> candidate
    D-->>B: <rpc-error> lock-denied, error-info session-id 21
    S->>D: <edit-config> target candidate (merge Gi2 description)
    D-->>S: <ok/>  (running unchanged)
    S->>D: <validate><source><candidate/></source></validate>
    D-->>S: <ok/>
    S->>D: <commit/>
    D-->>S: <ok/>  candidate → running, now live
    S->>D: <unlock> candidate
    D-->>S: <ok/>
    Note over S,D: unlock BEFORE commit = outstanding candidate changes are discarded
